        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "M. Civil Leave for Juror or Witness Service—Upon approval of the superintendent, a unit member who is subpoenaed as a witness in a civil or criminal case, or is called and serves on a jury, may be granted paid leave for that period of time he/she is unable to report to work. Application for leave must be made in advance and submitted with a copy of the subpoena. The unit member shall transmit any monies received from such assignment other than those used for personal expenses (e.g., travel) to the Board of Education.",
            "block_bbox": [
                71,
