        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "P. Leave for Unusual or Imperative Reasons—Employees may be granted leave by the superintendent for unusual or imperative reasons at no loss of pay, or at loss of full pay when no other leave is applicable. Approval must be secured before the absence occurs.",
