            "block_content": "1. All unit members may be granted up to four (4) days per year for personal leave. A written request for the intended absence shall be submitted to the principal or appropriate official at least one (1) day prior to the expected absence. No specific reason for such personal leave shall be required or solicited. Personal leave, if granted, must be used only to conduct personal",
